Restart the app (mvn spring-boot:run).
Log in as Suresh (suresh@example.com) and file a claim.
Log in as Admin (admin@example.com). You will see a Bell icon with a red badge and a Yellow alert box at the top of your dashboard saying "New Claim Submitted by Suresh".
